embership price\">$199/yr</span></span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-[#2A0B14] px-2.5 py-1 text-[12px] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-1-2\" data-name=\"band included badge\">Band $0</span></div>\n<div class=\"flex h-14 items-center justify-between border-t border-[#F3EFEC]\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-2\" data-name=\"membership row Peak\"><span data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-2-1\" data-name=\"membership plan name and price\"><span class=\"font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"membership plan name\">Peak</span> <span class=\"text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"membership price\">$299/yr</span></span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-[#2A0B14] px-2.5 py-1 text-[12px] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-2-2\" data-name=\"band included badge\">Band $0</span></div>\n<div class=\"flex h-14 items-center justify-between border-t border-[#F3EFEC]\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-3\" data-name=\"membership row Life\"><span data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-3-1\" data-name=\"membership plan name and price\"><span class=\"font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"membership plan name\">Life</span> <span class=\"text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-3-1-2\" data-name=\"membership price\">$399/yr</span></span><span class=\"rounded-full bg-[#2A0B14] px-2.5 py-1 text-[12px] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-3-2\" data-name=\"band included badge\">Band $0</span></div>\n<div class=\"flex h-14 items-center justify-between border-t border-[#F3EFEC]\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-4\" data-name=\"outright purchase row\"><span class=\"text-[#4A2A33]\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-4-1\" data-name=\"outright label\">Buy outright</span><span class=\"font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-2-1-3-2-4-4-4-2\" data-name=\"outright price\">$149</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- Pro -->\n<article class=\"band mx-4 mt-4 rounded-[28px] bg-[#2A0B14] px-[80px] pb-[80px] pt-[72px] text-[#FAF8F6]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3\" data-name=\"aero fit pro band card\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1248px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1\" data-name=\"band card content\">\n<h3 class=\"f-serif text-[46px] font-medium leading-[1.08]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-1\" data-name=\"band card title\">Aero Fit Pro</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 f-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.2] text-[#FAF8F6]/65\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-2\" data-name=\"band card subtitle\">Built-in GPS and ECG for structured training without your phone.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-[600px_620px] gap-7\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3\" data-name=\"band card two-column grid\">\n<div class=\"sticky top-[104px] self-start\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"band sticky media column\">\n<div class=\"relative h-[560px] overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] bg-[#F4F1EE]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"band media container with swap\">\n<img alt=\"Runner wearing Aero Fit Pro on a track\" class=\"absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover object-[center_40%]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"band main photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kombai-assets-dev.b-cdn.net/generated_assets/22958db3-c0cf-4d55-af69-a56c3814f90e/356b3e3c8d704bf4887b81203fda5357.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"media-alt absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center bg-[#F4F1EE] opacity-0\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"fallback product image container\">\n<img alt=\"Aero Fit Pro in Graphite\" class=\"w-[72%] mix-blend-multiply brightness-110 contrast-105\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"fallback cut-out image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kombai-assets.b-cdn.net/generated_assets/f9b46c42-f591-4385-bfc2-9b6663bcd54f/72180f80b3a64de99cbdef213dc621cd.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"band price/actions row\">\n<div data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"band price block\"><p class=\"text-[24px] font-semibold leading-none\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"band price value\">$299</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] text-[#FAF8F6]/75\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"band membership price note\">or $0 with a Peak membership</p></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"band action buttons\">\n<button class=\"h-11 rounded-full bg-white px-5 text-[14px] font-medium text-[#2A0B14] transition hover:bg-[#F3EFEC]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"add to cart button\">Add to cart</button>\n<a class=\"flex h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-white/40 px-5 text-[14px] font-medium transition hover:bg-white/10\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"details button\" href=\"#\">Details</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rail flex flex-col gap-4 text-[#2A0B14]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"band detail rail\">\n<div class=\"rounded-[24px] bg-[#F3EDE9] p-10\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"band summary card\"><p class=\"f-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.35]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"band summary copy\">Built-in GPS and ECG for structured training without your phone.</p></div>\n<div class=\"relative grid h-[360px] place-items-center overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] bg-[#F3EDE9]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"battery feature card\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 size-full\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"circular dashed decoration\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 620 360\"><ellipse cx=\"310\" cy=\"268\" rx=\"270\" ry=\"66\" stroke=\"#2A0B14\" stroke-dasharray=\"1.5 11\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-opacity=\"0.22\" stroke-width=\"5\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"310\" cy=\"268\" rx=\"190\" ry=\"44\" stroke=\"#2A0B14\" stroke-dasharray=\"1.5 11\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke-width=\"5\"></ellipse></svg>\n<div class=\"relative -mt-10 text-center\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"battery feature text\"><p class=\"text-[120px] font-medium leading-none tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"battery feature big number\">10<span class=\"ml-2 text-[52px] tracking-[-0.02em]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"battery feature unit\">days</span></p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"battery feature caption\">Battery on a single charge</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rounded-[24px] bg-[#F3EDE9] p-10\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"band closer-look card\">\n<h4 class=\"f-serif text-[24px] font-medium leading-none\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"band closer-look title\">A closer look at Aero Fit Pro</h4>\n<ul class=\"mt-6 divide-y divide-[#2A0B14]/10\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"band feature list\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"feature row: GPS\"><span class=\"grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"feature icon badge\"><i class=\"ti ti-map-pin text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"map-pin icon\"></i></span><div data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"feature text group\"><p class=\"text-[17px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"feature title\">Built-in GPS</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"feature description\">Leave the phone at home and still get pace and route.</p></div></li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"feature row: ECG\"><span class=\"grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"feature icon badge\"><i class=\"ti ti-heart-rate-monitor text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"heart-rate-monitor icon\"></i></span><div data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature text group\"><p class=\"text-[17px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"feature title\">ECG with Heart Screener</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature description\">Plus Blood Pressure Insights in the app.</p></div></li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 pt-5\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"feature row: battery\"><span class=\"grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"feature icon badge\"><i class=\"ti ti-battery-4 text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"battery icon\"></i></span><div data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"feature text group\"><p class=\"text-[17px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"feature title\">10 days of battery</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"feature description\">A full training week and then some.</p></div></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rounded-[24px] bg-[#F3EDE9] p-10\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"band tabs container\" data-tabs=\"\">\n<div class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-[#EFEAE6] bg-white p-1\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"band tabs group\" role=\"tablist\">\n<button aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"h-10 rounded-full bg-[#2A0B14] px-5 text-[14px] font-medium text-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"specifications tab\" data-tab=\"spec\">Specifications</button>\n<button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"h-10 rounded-full px-5 text-[14px] font-medium transition hover:bg-[#F3EFEC]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"colours-and-sizes tab\" data-tab=\"col\">Colours and sizes</button>\n<button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"h-10 rounded-full px-5 text-[14px] font-medium transition hover:bg-[#F3EFEC]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-1-3\" data-name=\"membership tab\" data-tab=\"mem\">Membership</button>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"mt-6 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-2\" 