ite colour swatch\"><span class=\"size-7 rounded-full bg-[#2E2E30]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Graphite swatch dot\"></span>Graphite</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-2-2\" data-name=\"Volt colour swatch\"><span class=\"size-7 rounded-full bg-[#E3E86A]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Volt swatch dot\"></span>Volt</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-2-3\" data-name=\"Stone colour swatch\"><span class=\"size-7 rounded-full bg-[#BDB5AC]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Stone swatch dot\"></span>Stone</span></div>\n<p class=\"mt-7 text-[13px] text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-3\" data-name=\"band sizes label\">Band sizes</p>\n<div class=\"mt-1 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-4\" data-name=\"band sizes list\"><div class=\"flex h-14 items-center justify-between border-b border-[#2A0B14]/10\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-4-1\" data-name=\"size row S\"><span class=\"font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"size letter S\">S</span><span data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-4-1-2\" data-name=\"circumference range\">130–160 mm</span></div><div class=\"flex h-14 items-center justify-between border-b border-[#2A0B14]/10\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-4-2\" data-name=\"size row M\"><span class=\"font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"size letter M\">M</span><span data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"circumference range\">150–190 mm</span></div><div class=\"flex h-14 items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-4-3\" data-name=\"size row L\"><span class=\"font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-4-3-1\" data-name=\"size letter L\">L</span><span data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-3-4-3-2\" data-name=\"circumference range\">180–220 mm</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-6 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-3-1-3-2-4-4\" data-name=\"membership panel (hidden)\" data-panel=\"mem\" hidden=\"\">\n<d