ound\" stroke-opacity=\"0.06\" stroke-width=\"30\"></path>\n<path class=\"u-arc\" d=\"M 70 470 A 230 230 0 0 1 530 470\" filter=\"url(#voltBlur)\" pathlength=\"100\" stroke=\"#F8F38A\" stroke-dasharray=\"100\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"54\"></path>\n<path class=\"u-arc\" d=\"M 70 470 A 230 230 0 0 1 530 470\" pathlength=\"100\" stroke=\"url(#voltArc)\" stroke-dasharray=\"100\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"30\"></path>\n</svg>\n<div class=\"absolute left-[130px] top-[140px] w-[340px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"ultra device container\">\n<img alt=\"Aero Fit Ultra in Titanium\" class=\"u-device w-full mix-blend-multiply brightness-110 contrast-105\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"ultra device cut-out image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kombai-assets.b-cdn.net/generated_assets/f9b46c42-f591-4385-bfc2-9b6663bcd54f/76d7a24f75bc4dbeafec4d446b539a12.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<span class=\"absolute left-5 top-5 rounded-full bg-[#2A0B14] px-2.5 py-1 text-[12px] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"ships Nov 4 badge\">Ships Nov 4</span>\n<div class=\"media-alt absolute inset-0 opacity-0\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-1-4\" data-name=\"fallback photo container\">\n<img alt=\"Aero Fit Ultra on a mossy summit rock\" class=\"size-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"fallback photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kombai-assets-dev.b-cdn.net/generated_assets/22958db3-c0cf-4d55-af69-a56c3814f90e/1554a09252854047951ad166e87cafc5.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"band price/actions row\">\n<div data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"band price block\"><p class=\"text-[24px] font-semibold leading-none\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"band price value\">$399</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"band membership price note\">or $0 with a Life membership</p></div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"band action buttons\">\n<button class=\"h-11 rounded-full bg-[#2A0B14] px-5 text-[14px] font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-[#45172A]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"pre-order button\">Pre-order</button>\n<a class=\"flex h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-[#D9D0CB] bg-white px-5 text-[14px] font-medium transition hover:bg-[#F3EFEC]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"details button\" href=\"#\">Details</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rail flex flex-col gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2\" data-name=\"band detail rail\">\n<div class=\"relative grid h-[360px] place-items-center overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] bg-[#FAF8F6]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"battery feature card\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 size-full\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"circular dashed decoration\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 620 360\"><ellipse cx=\"310\" cy=\"268\" rx=\"270\" ry=\"66\" stroke=\"#2A0B14\" stroke-dasharray=\"1.5 11\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-opacity=\"0.22\" stroke-width=\"5\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"310\" cy=\"268\" rx=\"190\" ry=\"44\" stroke=\"#2A0B14\" stroke-dasharray=\"1.5 11\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-opacity=\"0.14\" stroke-width=\"5\"></ellipse></svg>\n<div class=\"relative -mt-10 text-center\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"battery feature text\"><p class=\"text-[120px] font-medium leading-none tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"battery feature big number\">14<span class=\"ml-2 text-[52px] tracking-[-0.02em]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"battery feature unit\">days</span></p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"battery feature caption\">Battery on a single charge</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rounded-[24px] bg-[#FAF8F6] p-10\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"band summary card\"><p class=\"f-serif text-[28px] leading-[1.35]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"band summary copy\">Titanium case, dual-band GPS and two weeks of battery for multi-day races and long training blocks.</p></div>\n<div class=\"rounded-[24px] bg-[#FAF8F6] p-10\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"band closer-look card\">\n<h4 class=\"f-serif text-[24px] font-medium leading-none\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"band closer-look title\">A closer look at Aero Fit Ultra</h4>\n<ul class=\"mt-6 divide-y divide-[#EFEAE6]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"band feature list\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"feature row: Dual-band GPS\"><span class=\"grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"feature icon badge\"><i class=\"ti ti-current-location text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"current-location icon\"></i></span><div data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"feature text group\"><p class=\"text-[17px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"feature title\">Dual-band GPS</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"feature description\">Holds a clean track under trees and between buildings.</p></div></li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"feature row: Titanium\"><span class=\"grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"feature icon badge\"><i class=\"ti ti-diamond text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"diamond icon\"></i></span><div data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature text group\"><p class=\"text-[17px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"feature title\">Titanium and sapphire</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature description\">A titanium case and a sapphire-covered AMOLED display.</p></div></li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-5 pt-5\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"feature row: Water resistance\"><span class=\"grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"feature icon badge\"><i class=\"ti ti-droplet text-[20px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"droplet icon\"></i></span><div data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"feature text group\"><p class=\"text-[17px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"feature title\">Water resistant to 100 m</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#6B4F57]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"feature description\">Twice the rating of the rest of the range.</p></div></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rounded-[24px] bg-[#FAF8F6] p-10\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"band tabs container\" data-tabs=\"\">\n<div class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-[#EFEAE6] bg-white p-1\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"band tabs group\" role=\"tablist\">\n<button aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"h-10 rounded-full bg-[#2A0B14] px-5 text-[14px] font-medium text-white\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"specifications tab\" data-tab=\"spec\">Specifications</button>\n<button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"h-10 rounded-full px-5 text-[14px] font-medium transition hover:bg-[#F3EFEC]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"colours-and-sizes tab\" data-tab=\"col\">Colours and sizes</button>\n<button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"h-10 rounded-full px-5 text-[14px] font-medium transition hover:bg-[#F3EFEC]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-4-1-3\" data-name=\"membership tab\" data-tab=\"mem\">Membership</button>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"mt-6 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-6-4-1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"specifications panel\" da